            "notes": "I like going for full weapon power and doubling down on it in round 2, you wont have much else to defend yourself with since the \"hybrid\" part of this build isn't quite online yet. If you're a rich Mercy on round 1, congrats, and feel free to go for any of the optional items as well (especially some survivability items if you keep dying to the Soldier ult or the Cassidy 2 shotting you)! I've found Ironclad Exhaustports to be a huge help if you do need that little extra survivability since we'll be using our GA to get away from enemies and get to our next beam target.",
