            "created_at": "2025-08-27T22:32:10.53863+00:00",
            "notes": "For round 3, you've got whambulance to do good burst heals. I've noticed that keeping it fairly 50/50 with more power in ability so that burst heal can really do a lot even if you only GA by a few metres safely. This pairs well later on if you get to round 7 for triage unit since the burst heal will apply no matter what, along with your beam doing more heals. I prefer to flick rapidly between damage boost and heals, but a lot of the time you can get away with lingering that damage boost a little bit longer without issue to make sure your teammate gets that kill.",
